# pc-ui

This repo is `@miquelt9/pc-ui` — Windows 9x CSS tokens, primitives, and thin React wrappers.

When changing this package or helping wire it into consumers (miquelt9.github.io, bingo-musical, etc.), follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md):

- CSS-first; import `@miquelt9/pc-ui/primitives.css` separately from JS
- Keep React wrappers presentational (no drag/window manager keybinds)
- Preserve visual tokens; do not reinvent colors or bevels
- For multi-pane fullscreen layouts, use `Desktop tiled` + `Workspace` + `Split` + `Window fill` (see AGENTS.md)
- Vanilla sites: alias existing classes onto `.pc-*`
- Bingo: restyle chrome only; keep print/PDF white and non-Win98
